From 3275326d8c7ebc4e7b146a3837891760cd9af186 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 05:37:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Order totals, global new-order alerts, printable bills,
 ordering and inventory hiding

- Ticket Rail: total bill on every order card (subtotal on held tickets)
- New-order alert on every page (banner + chime + optional desktop notification), skips orders this device placed
- Print supplier payment bill and expense voucher (receipt printer in the desktop app, print dialog in the browser)
- Expense categories can be rearranged (Users & Permissions); Expenses lists follow it
- Inventory: Remove hides an item (soft delete) only when no product / self-made recipe uses it
- Popups scroll when taller than the screen (shared Modal + custom popups)
- POS: categories wrap, order panel width is draggable, items follow the Menu page order
- Menu: Rearrange items per category (products.sort_order)
- Only clocked-in riders can be assigned deliveries
- Migration 0029: products.sort_order, expense_categories.sort_order, inventory_items.deleted_at
